<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Portal de proveedores | Gas Tomza</title><link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="/css/login.css" rel="stylesheet"></head><body>
<header class="login-topbar"><a href="/" class="login-wordmark">Gas Tomza <span>Portal de proveedores</span></a><a href="/">Acceso interno <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></header>
<main class="login-shell"><section class="brand-panel"><div class="brand-mark"><img src="/img/logo_tomza.jpg" alt="Gas Tomza"><div><div class="brand-kicker">Relaciones que suman</div><div class="brand-name">Portal de proveedores</div></div></div><h1 class="hero-title">Tus facturas.<br>Tu información.<br><span>Siempre a mano.</span></h1><p class="hero-copy">Un espacio para presentar tus facturas, seguir su revisión y consultar los pagos de Gas Tomza.</p><div class="feature-row"><span class="feature-pill">Carga de XML y PDF</span><span class="feature-pill">Estado de facturas</span><span class="feature-pill">Consulta de pagos</span></div></section>
<section class="login-card"><div class="login-card-header"><div class="access-label">ACCESO DE PROVEEDORES</div><h2 class="login-title">Bienvenido de nuevo</h2><p class="login-subtitle">Ingresá con la cuenta de tu empresa.</p></div><div class="login-card-body">
<% if(error){ %><div class="alert alert-danger rounded-4" role="alert"><%= error %></div><% } %>
<form method="POST" action="/portal-proveedores/login" class="d-grid gap-3"><div><label class="form-label" for="email">Correo electrónico</label><input class="form-control" id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="username" placeholder="nombre@empresa.com" required maxlength="254"></div><div><label class="form-label" for="password">Contraseña</label><div class="password-field"><input class="form-control" id="password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="Ingresá tu contraseña" required maxlength="128"><button type="button" data-toggle-password="password" aria-label="Mostrar contraseña" aria-pressed="false">Mostrar</button></div></div><button class="btn btn-login">Ingresar al portal <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></form><p class="login-help">¿Es tu primera vez? Solicitá tu acceso a Administración de Gas Tomza.</p></div><div class="login-footer">Para recuperar tu acceso, contactá a Administración.</div></section></main><footer class="login-bottom">Gas Tomza · Portal empresarial</footer><script src="/js/login.js" defer></script></body></html>